        "note": "title card"
      },
      {
        "index": 1,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 2,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "US agencies change the Code of Federal Regulations by publishing instructions like this one. Remove this exact sentence.",
        "words": 18,
        "duration": 6.4,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 2,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "The Office of the Federal Register has to find that sentence in the text. Look at the quoted words.",
        "words": 19,
        "duration": 6.8,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 2,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "The rule says notion of exemption. The Code says notice. One word, and there is nothing to remove.",
        "words": 18,
        "duration": 6.4,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 3,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "So the amendment could not go in. The National Archives publishes this note instead.",
        "words": 14,
        "duration": 5.0,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 3,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "It is permanent, it is citable, and the text it targeted never changed.",
        "words": 13,
        "duration": 4.6,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 6,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 4,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "The simple baseline is one prompt. Give a model the instruction, ask whether it will execute. No Code text, no tools.",
        "words": 21,
        "duration": 7.5,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 7,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 4,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "On eighty-two items it scores forty-seven point six percent. That is a coin flip, and it should be.",
        "words": 18,
        "duration": 6.4,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 8,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 4,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "The instruction alone does not contain the answer.",
        "words": 8,
        "duration": 3.0,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 9,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 5,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "Here is the whole system. Two inputs: the amendatory instruction, and the CFR text as it stood the day before.",
        "words": 20,
        "duration": 7.1,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 10,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 5,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "For every instruction a deterministic resolver answers two questions, and each answer is written to a trace.",
        "words": 17,
        "duration": 6.1,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 11,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 5,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "The verdict is computed from that trace in code. Anything contradictory is refused rather than guessed.",
        "words": 16,
        "duration": 5.7,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 13,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 6,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "Now the same case, step by step. Forty CFR seventy-five point six.",
        "words": 12,
        "duration": 4.3,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 14,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 6,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "The agent gets four instructions, and the section text as it stood before the rule was published.",
        "words": 17,
        "duration": 6.1,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 15,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 7,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "For each instruction it calls the resolver. Is this paragraph declared? Is this quoted string present?",
        "words": 16,
        "duration": 5.7,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 16,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 7,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "Here is the real call and the real answer. The resolver says paragraph a thirty-eight does not exist.",
        "words": 18,
        "duration": 6.4,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 17,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 8,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "Then it writes the editorial note the Archives would have to publish. Not a yes or no.",
        "words": 17,
        "duration": 6.1,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 18,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 8,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "The failing designation, the failure class in the Archives' own vocabulary, and the full trace.",
        "words": 15,
        "duration": 5.4,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 19,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 8,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "The verdict is derived in code from that trace, so it cannot be right for the wrong reason.",
        "words": 18,
        "duration": 6.4,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 20,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 9,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "On this case, something I did not expect happened. The resolver was wrong: it cannot see nested designations.",
        "words": 18,
        "duration": 6.4,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 21,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 9,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "The model read the section text, saw paragraph thirty-eight sitting there, and overrode its own tool.",
        "words": 16,
        "duration": 5.7,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 22,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 9,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "It named the tool's limitation in the published note. And it ruled correctly.",
        "words": 13,
        "duration": 4.6,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 23,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 10,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "Two results, and the second is a null. Giving the agent the Code text moves accuracy from forty-seven point six",
        "words": 20,
        "duration": 7.1,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 24,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 10,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "to sixty-five point nine. Plus eighteen point three points, p equals zero point zero zero six. That is real.",
        "words": 19,
        "duration": 6.8,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 25,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 10,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "Adding our two capabilities gets seventy-one point nine five. Plus six point one points, p equals zero point four two.",
        "words": 20,
        "duration": 7.1,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 26,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 10,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "That is not significant. Our pre-registered criterion had four clauses. We met none. It ships unmet.",
        "words": 16,
        "duration": 5.7,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 27,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 11,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "Every iteration was predicted before it ran, and the predictions are timestamped in git.",
        "words": 14,
        "duration": 5.0,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 28,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 11,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "Iteration one was the resolver. Predicted plus eight points, measured minus nine point eight. Wrong direction. Removed.",
        "words": 17,
        "duration": 6.1,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 29,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 11,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "Iteration two was the written procedure. Predicted zero point eight one, measured zero point seven two.",
        "words": 16,
        "duration": 5.7,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 30,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 11,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "That prediction was committed seven hundred and sixty-four seconds before the arm ran.",
        "words": 13,
        "duration": 4.6,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 31,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 12,
        "step": 1,
        "caption": "The tool alone made it worse.",
        "words": 6,
        "duration": 3.0,
        "note": "reveal 1 of 4"
      },
      {
        "index": 32,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 12,
        "step": 2,
        "caption": "The procedure alone made it worse.",
        "words": 6,
        "duration": 3.0,
        "note": "reveal 2 of 4"
      },
      {
        "index": 33,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 12,
        "step": 3,
        "caption": "Together, plus six point one points.",
        "words": 6,
        "duration": 3.0,
        "note": "reveal 3 of 4"
      },
      {
        "index": 34,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 12,
        "step": 4,
        "caption": "Neither helps on its own. It composes because the procedure repairs a defect in the tool that we left unfixed and documented.",
        "words": 22,
        "duration": 7.9,
        "note": "reveal 4 of 4"
      },
      {
        "index": 35,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 13,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "One experiment we removed. We predicted the current Code text would raise accuracy, because it leaks the answer.",
        "words": 18,
        "duration": 6.4,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 36,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 13,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "It fell six point one points. The prediction was wrong, and it is published as wrong.",
        "words": 16,
        "duration": 5.7,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 37,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 14,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "That page is the deliverable. Every item carries its trace, and the level each anchor actually resolved at.",
        "words": 18,
        "duration": 6.4,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 38,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 14,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": "Sixteen of eighty-two are not decided by the tool. They go to a person, each with its reason.",
        "words": 18,
        "duration": 6.4,
        "note": ""
      },
      {
        "index": 39,
        "source": "deck",
        "slide": 15,
        "step": 0,
        "caption": null,
        "words": 0,
        "duration": 11.8,
        "note": "the hot take, uncaptioned - 33 words on the slide"
      },
      {
        "index": 40,
        "source": "docs/video/endcard.html",
        "slide": null,
        "step": 0,
